{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115457","id":3215090986,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6_omUq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115457","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115457.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115457.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115457","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115457/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115457/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115457/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b297253f52d3c80e0ca0dd6c716e6e6f55923586","number":115457,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add upload progress tracking to `HTTPClient` and `HTTPRequest`","user":{"login":"madebydavid","id":5401249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDEyNDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5401249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid","html_url":"https://github.com/madebydavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is to resolve https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1221\r\n\r\n# What's changed:\r\n\r\n- Added a `get_request_bytes_sent` method on `HTTPClient` which returns bytes sent so far during a request\r\n- Added a `get_uploaded_bytes` method on `HTTPRequest` which exposes the `get_request_bytes_sent` on the underlying `HTTPClient`\r\n- Documentation for both new methods including an example\r\n\r\nA note about the implmentation - `request_buffer->get_position()` resets to 0 as soon as we have finished sending to the server - but before the request is completed - this is because the internal buffer is cleared and we are still waiting for a response from the server.\r\n\r\nBecause of this nuance, I have included an example (gdscript and c#) in the documentation\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nwhile http.get_status() == HTTPClient.STATUS_REQUESTING:\r\n    http.poll()\r\n    var sent := http.get_request_bytes_sent()\r\n    if sent > 0:\r\n        var percent := (sent * 100.0) / total_bytes\r\n        print(\"Uploading: %.1f%%\" % percent)\r\n    await get_tree().process_frame\r\n```\r\n\r\nFor the Web platform, the methods return `-1` - I have looked into implementing this for the `fetch` based web version of the `HTTPClient` - there are some browser compatibility issues https://stackoverflow.com/a/69400632/2779152 \r\n\r\nThis is my first contribution to Godot  - very happy to hear feedback and make changes.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":649800701,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDk4MDA3MDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:network","name":"topic:network","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin